---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /experiences/
title: Experiences That Matter
description: Real, hands-on experiences that build leadership, teamwork and innovation — in the words of LYNK students, parents and mentors.
socialImage: /assets/img/experiences/story-1.jpg
---

<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero__media" src="/assets/img/hero/experiences.webp" alt="" width="1280" height="855" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="hero__scrim"></div>
  <div class="hero__content">
    <h1>Experiences That Matter</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--center">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <p class="lede prose prose--center">
      At Inspire Carolina Inc. and LYNK Robotics, we believe the most powerful
      growth happens through real, hands-on experiences. Our students take on
      meaningful challenges—designing and building competitive robots, solving
      complex problems together, and engaging with the wider community. These
      moments spark inspiration while also building practical skills in
      leadership, teamwork, and innovation. The result is more than just a season
      of robotics—it’s an experience that prepares young people to thrive and make
      a lasting impact wherever life takes them.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{%- for story in experiences %}
  <section class="section{% if loop.index is odd %} section--alt{% endif %}">
    <div class="section__inner">
      <div class="split">
        {%- if loop.index is odd %}
          <div class="media-frame">
            <img src="{{ story.image }}" alt="" width="1000" height="700" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        {%- endif %}

        <div class="stack">
          <h2>{{ story.title }}</h2>
          <blockquote style="margin: 0; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid var(--orange)">
            <p>{{ story.quote }}</p>
            {%- if story.attribution %}
              <footer style="font-weight: 700">/ {{ story.attribution }}</footer>
            {%- endif %}
          </blockquote>
          <a class="btn" href="{{ site.links.highlightForm }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
            {{ story.cta }}
          </a>
        </div>

        {%- if loop.index is even %}
          <div class="media-frame">
            <img src="{{ story.image }}" alt="" width="1000" height="700" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{%- endfor %}
